{
    "background_story": "In a world where machines had become an integral part of daily life, Clover was designed to be the ultimate substitutable robot. Created by a team of brilliant engineers, Clover's advanced AI and modular design allowed her to adapt to any situation. She could seamlessly switch between being a personal assistant, a chef, or even a medical aid, making her an indispensable asset to any household. With her interchangeable limbs and advanced software, Clover could learn new skills and take on new roles with ease. She quickly became a favorite among families, who appreciated her ability to fill in for any missing member or skillset. Whether it was helping with homework or walking the dog, Clover was always ready to substitute and lend a helping hand.",
